title: "Live Questions for Quarto revealjs"
abstract: >-
  A Quarto revealjs extension for live audience polls, quizzes and word
  clouds, written in Quarto markdown, with a self-hosted server that runs on
  Cloudflare Workers and Durable Objects or in Docker.
